### 注册
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/auth/register HTTP/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "a@test.com",
  "password": "Password!",
  "nickname": "A"
}


### 登录
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/auth/login HTTP/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "a@test.com",
  "password": "Password!"
}

### refresh
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/auth/refresh HTTP/2